  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "For the Part Provision Team, the first step is to identify the parts."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If the team needs to elicit information from the customer"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "they should then check the availability of the parts."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "On the other hand, if they already have the availability information, they can proceed with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If the parts are supplied to the customer, the team can also continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "However, if they need to record the customer's details"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "they should order and receive the part from Disuki."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Once the part is received, the team can then contract the customer."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "After all the necessary parts are collected, the team can proceed with the payment."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "Once the payment is made, the process comes to an end."
    }
  ]
}